# 行尾策略 / Line-ending policy
#
# GitHub 的「Download ZIP」不走 core.autocrlf，所以必须在仓库里钉死：
# ZIP downloads from GitHub bypass core.autocrlf, so the repo itself has to pin this.
#
# 顺序有意义：后面的规则覆盖前面的（* 也会匹配 *.cmd）。

* text=auto

# cmd.exe 解析 LF-only 批处理会在标签、括号块上出错；.vbs 同理，保持 CRLF 原样存储。
# cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only batch files (labels, parenthesised blocks); keep CRLF, stored as-is.
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
*.vbs -text

# 图标是二进制，禁止任何转换
*.ico -text
